# 🚀 Markivo — Full Product Overview & Build Plan


---

## 1. EXECUTIVE SUMMARY

**One-line pitch:**
An AI-powered marketing operating system that builds, manages, and grows a business's entire online presence — from zero to fully running — across every major platform, automatically.

**The problem it solves:**
Small and medium businesses — especially in emerging markets like Uzbekistan and Central Asia — have no marketing infrastructure, no marketing team, and no idea where to start. Western tools like HubSpot assume you already have a presence and a marketing team. This platform assumes you have neither.

**The solution:**
A guided, intelligent system that either discovers your existing marketing presence or builds one entirely from scratch — then manages it, grows it, and automates it using AI — in Uzbek, Russian, and English.

**Target markets:**
Global launch with deep localization for Uzbekistan, Central Asia, and CIS regions first.

