## 4. CORE FEATURES & PRODUCT SCOPE

### 4.1 Onboarding — Two Paths

#### PATH A: "I Already Have Something" — Discovery Mode
When a business says they already have marketing presence, the system:

1. Takes business name + location input
2. Scans the internet and aggregates all found data:
   - Google Business Profile / Google Maps listing
   - All social media accounts (Instagram, TikTok, Telegram, X, YouTube, Facebook)
   - Website / landing page
   - Reviews (Google, 2GIS, Yandex Maps, etc.)
   - SEO ranking and keywords
   - AI search presence (ChatGPT, Perplexity mentions)
   - Any running ads (Google Ads, Meta Ads)
   - Competitor mentions
3. Displays results in a clean confirm/reject UI (✓ / ✗ per item)
4. User verifies, corrects, or adds missing assets
5. System connects to confirmed platforms via OAuth / API
6. Dashboard populates with live data from all connected platforms

#### PATH B: "I Have Nothing" — Build From Scratch Mode
Full guided setup wizard. All questions are asked first, then all actions execute in order. User sees a live minimal progress feed ("Creating Google Business Profile... ✓") while actions run.

**Question Sequence:**
1. **Business Category** — dropdown + search
2. **Business Description** — short text: *"Describe your business in 2-3 sentences"*
3. **Location** — specific address input OR toggle: *"We operate online / remotely"*
4. **Target Audience** — open text: *"Who is your ideal customer?"*
5. **Brand Tone** — multiple choice (select one):
   - Cozy & Warm
   - Modern & Minimalist
   - Energetic & Fast-paced
   - Professional & Trustworthy
   - Playful & Fun
   - Luxury & Premium
6. **Brand Identity / Slogan** — *"How should customers remember you?"*
   - User enters their own, OR
   - Click "Generate 3 examples" → choose one, OR
   - Click "Generate again" for new options
7. **Logo** — *"Do you have a logo?"*
   - Yes → Upload logo
   - No → AI generates logo based on brand tone + slogan
8. **Website** — *"Enter your website URL"* (leave blank if none)
9. **Existing Social Accounts** — multi-select checkboxes (Instagram, TikTok, Telegram, X, WhatsApp Business, YouTube, Facebook) with "I don't have any" option

**Action Sequence (runs after all questions answered):**
Progress shown in minimal live feed bottom of screen:
1. ✦ Generate brand identity package (logo, color palette, tone guidelines)
2. ✦ Create Google Business Profile
3. ✦ Create Instagram account
4. ✦ Create TikTok account
5. ✦ Create Telegram business channel
6. ✦ Create X (Twitter) account
7. ✦ Create WhatsApp Business account
8. ✦ Generate website / landing page (Ultimate tier only)
9. ✦ Set up SEO baseline
10. ✦ Build initial content calendar

> **Technical Note:** Social media account creation via automation violates most platform ToS. The real implementation must use the business owner's own email/credentials + guided OAuth flows, NOT programmatic account creation. The UX feels automated from the user's side but technically the user authorizes each step.

