### 4.3 Content Engine

#### AI Content Creation
- Auto-generate captions, posts, stories for each platform (tone-matched to brand)
- Platform-specific formatting (Instagram caption ≠ Telegram post ≠ TikTok caption)
- Scheduled posting across all connected platforms
- Hashtag research and auto-tagging

#### Photo & Video Workflow
- **Tutorial mode:** AI gives the user step-by-step instructions on how to shoot a promo photo or video using just their phone (lighting, angle, framing tips — matched to their business category)
- **Upload & Enhance:** User uploads raw photo/video → AI automatically:
  - Enhances image quality
  - Edits and trims video
  - Adds captions/subtitles
  - Formats for each platform (Reels, TikTok, YouTube Shorts, Telegram)
  - Posts across platforms with generated descriptions

#### AI Video Generation (Pro & Ultimate)
- Full AI-generated promotional videos using business info + brand assets
- Pro: 3 videos/week
- Ultimate: 7 videos/week

#### UGC (User Generated Content) Engine
- Auto-detects and aggregates UGC mentioning the business
- Suggests reposts and engagement responses
- Tracks brand mentions across platforms

