### 4.6 AI Agent

The platform's always-available AI assistant and task executor.

**Automatic (no approval needed):**
- Gmail inbox monitoring, summarizing, and sorting
- Responding to known/FAQ emails using learned business knowledge (Ultimate)
- Scheduling and publishing approved content
- Tracking analytics and flagging anomalies

**Always requires human approval:**
- Sending any new email reply to an unknown contact
- Publishing any content for the first time
- Creating or modifying any ad campaign
- Any action involving money (ad spend, etc.)
- Any response to a customer complaint or review

**Agent Learning:**
- Ultimate tier: When agent encounters an unknown email question, it flags it, asks the owner for the answer, stores it, and uses it autonomously for all future similar questions.

