**Frontend:**
- Next.js (React) — web app
- Tailwind CSS — styling
- Framer Motion — animations
- Mobile-responsive first

**Backend:**
- Node.js + Express OR Python FastAPI
- PostgreSQL — primary database
- Redis — caching, job queues
