## 11. RISKS & HONEST CHALLENGES

| Risk | Severity | Mitigation |
|---|---|---|
| Platform API policy changes (Meta, TikTok) | High | Build abstraction layer; don't over-depend on any single API |
| Social media account creation ToS violations | High | Use guided OAuth, never programmatic creation |
| "Does everything" = "does nothing well" | High | MVP is ruthlessly scoped: onboarding + 2 platforms + content only |
| Distribution / user acquisition | High | Founder-led sales first, build in public, free tier as hook |
| AI costs eating margin | Medium | Token budgets per tier, monitor closely, optimize prompts |
| Bigger player copies the idea | Medium | Move fast, build local moat, relationships > features |
| Founder burnout (solo build) | Medium | Strict MVP scope, no feature creep until paying customers exist |

